                    {
                        "sense_id": "518eb710-5cdb-384a-b6b2-54252266777f",
                        "entry_id": "52f75abe-1c9b-357b-8777-9491c1d3d70b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of стари́к (starík): old woman"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "900a4874-df2c-443c-9bb3-4df913af53a5",
                                "sense_id": "518eb710-5cdb-384a-b6b2-54252266777f",
                                "text": "Ми́мо прошла́ стару́ха с кото́мкой. Княги́ня поду́мала, что хорошо́ бы останови́ть э́ту стару́ху и сказа́ть ей что́-нибудь ла́сковое, задуше́вное, помо́чь ей… Но стару́ха ни ра́зу не огляну́лась и поверну́ла за у́гол.",
                                "translation": "An old woman passed by with a wallet on her back. The princess thought that it would be nice to stop the old woman and to say something friendly and cordial to her, to help her. . . . But the old woman turned the corner without once looking round.",
                                "english": "An old woman passed by with a wallet on her back. The princess thought that it would be nice to stop the old woman and to say something friendly and cordial to her, to help her. . . . But the old woman turned the corner without once looking round."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
